904
01:07:56,460 --> 01:07:57,300
OK?

905
01:07:57,300 --> 01:07:59,422
So that's the proof.

906
01:08:03,278 --> 01:08:07,640
All right, unfortunately,
it's like doing magic.

907
01:08:07,640 --> 01:08:12,269
Once you reveal the trick, it
