935
01:09:59,590 --> 01:10:02,470
So we've completed that
thermodynamic temperature

936
01:10:02,470 --> 01:10:03,460
scale.

937
01:10:03,460 --> 01:10:07,160
If I understood correctly
the question that was posed,

938
01:10:07,160 --> 01:10:12,260
